d Guard units, but at the start of Operation Bagration the T-34-85's formed the bulk of Soviet tank units. By the end of the war 23,213 units had been manufactured.","LocalizedString":"The T-34-85 was a Soviet medium tank used in WWII by the Red Army. It was an upgraded T-34 tank, with an enlarged turret ring which allowed it to be fitted with an 85 mm gun. For secondary armament it had two DT 7.62 mm (0.3 in) machine-guns, one coaxial and one in the hull. The T-34-85 was introduced in 1943 and it was instantly liked by its crew. To begin with they were delivered to Elite and Guard units, but at the start of Operation Bagration the T-34-85's formed the bulk of Soviet tank units. By the end of the war 23,213 units had been manufactured."},"operationCost":2,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Common","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Basic","isReserved":true,"EffectType":"ECardEffectTypes::Trigger","usedTriggers":["ERegisteredCardFunction::OnBeforeOtherCardPlayedFromHand"],"extraHelpTextBubbleTypes":["EHelpBubbleTypes::HeavyArmor1","EHelpBubbleTypes::Trigger"],"draftBaseWeight":1.5,"heavyArmor":1,"soundEnterPlay":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Tank_Heavy_Move_Fx'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Units/Tank_Heavy_Move_Fx.0"},"soundMoveToFrontline":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Tank_Heavy_Move_Fx'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Units/Tank_Heavy_Move_Fx.0"},"soundAttack":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Heavy_artillery_2'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/ExplosionSoundPack/ExplosionSounds/Wavs/Heavy_artillery_2.0"},"soundBlowUp":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Explosion_Huge'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Misc/Explosion_Huge.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Soviet/t_t_34_85.t_t_34_85","SubPathString":""},"artist":"David Pentland","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/T-34-85.T-34-85","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":339.0},"historyPhotoSource":"https://ww2db.com","historyPhotoAuthor":"Mark Markov-Grinberg","his